      "date": "2021-11-24",
      "status": "Final",
      "version": null,
      "parent_document_id": null,
      "version_group": null,
      "text": "LEGAL OPINION\n\nMatter: Sarin-Loyal Limited \u2014 Liquidation\nMatter Code: INS/BLR/0002/2021\nClient: Sarin-Loyal Limited\nAuthor: Ayushman Chander (Partner)\nDate: 2021-11-24\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nLEGAL OPINION (PRIVILEGED)\n\nWe are asked to advise Sarin-Loyal Limited on Fair and equitable treatment, CoC commercial wisdom, Personal guarantees.\nFacts instructed:\n- Operational creditors challenged distribution\n Exposure is in the region of \u20b9645.4 crore.\n\nOur opinion: the better view is aligned with: Debt and default are established from the facility documents.\nCaveat: Claim is in the nature of an operational debt.\nThis opinion may not be disclosed to third parties without written consent.\n",
      "contains_amount": true,
      "contains_court": false,
      "contains_weather_fact": false
