      "text": "ENGAGEMENT LETTER\n\nMatter: Sarin-Loyal Limited \u2014 Liquidation\nMatter Code: INS/BLR/0002/2021\nClient: Sarin-Loyal Infra.\nAuthor: Tripti Yadav (Partner)\nDate: 2022-09-20\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nWe are pleased to confirm our engagement by Sarin-Loyal Limited in connection with Liquidation (INS/BLR/0002/2021).\n\nScope: advice and representation concerning Corporate insolvency resolution.\nRetainer: standard Apex Chambers terms. Privilege applies.\nConflicts: checked against Northline Construction Co..\n",
