      "text": "LEGAL OPINION\n\nMatter: Khatri Energy Ltd. \u2014 Liquidation\nMatter Code: INS/BLR/0003/2025\nClient: Khatri Energy\nAuthor: Daksh Karnik (Counsel)\nDate: 2026-04-04\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nLEGAL OPINION (PRIVILEGED)\n\nWe are asked to advise Khatri Energy Ltd. on Fair and equitable treatment, Financial debt, Personal guarantees.\nFacts instructed:\n- Financial creditor filed a Section 7 petition\n Exposure is in the region of \u20b91188.9 crore.\n\nOur opinion: the better view is aligned with: Debt and default are established from the facility documents.\nCaveat: Claim is in the nature of an operational debt.\nThis opinion may not be disclosed to third parties without written consent.\n",
