      "text": "INITIAL CASE ASSESSMENT\n\nMatter: Solanki Holdings v State Urban Development Authority\nMatter Code: DIS/BLR/0004/2020\nClient: Solanki Holdings Ltd.\nAuthor: Ekavir Varkey (Associate)\nDate: 2020-06-03\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nThis initial case assessment records work on DIS/BLR/0004/2020.\nIssues in view: Contractual delay, Force majeure, Liquidated damages.\nFacts touched: EPC contractor delayed project completion.\nWorking outcome: Award in favour of employer.\n\nCross-ref (possibly wrong): see also MTR-2020-00000 internal KM dump.\n",
