      "version_group": null,
      "text": "CLIENT EMAIL\n\nMatter: Solanki Holdings v State Urban Development Authority\nMatter Code: DIS/BLR/0004/2020\nClient: Solanki Holdings\nAuthor: Ekavir Varkey (Associate)\nDate: 2020-07-12\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nFrom: client-contact@solanki.example\nSubject: Re: update\n\nTeam \u2014 flagging that exceptional weather event is still the factual centre of gravity from our side.\nEPC contractor delayed project completion.\nWe do not want this email to be a full recitation of the case; the assessment memo has the rest.\n\nPlease call if you need anything from site.\n",
