      "text": "MATTER CLOSURE MEMO\n\nMatter: Solanki Holdings v State Urban Development Authority\nMatter Code: DIS/BLR/0004/2020\nClient: Solanki Holdings Ltd.\nAuthor: Wahab Raval (Paralegal)\nDate: 2021-02-13\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nMATTER CLOSURE\nStatus: Stayed\nOutcome: Award in favour of employer.\nLessons: preserve notice trails; Force majeure remains a recurring Disputes theme.\nKM: tag this file under flood_force_majeure.\n",
