      "version_group": null,
      "text": "DRAFT ARGUMENTS\n\nMatter: Solanki Holdings v State Urban Development Authority\nMatter Code: DIS/BLR/0004/2020\nClient: Solanki Holdings Ltd.\nAuthor: Wahab Raval (Paralegal)\nDate: 2021-04-02\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nOUTLINE OF SUBMISSIONS \u2014 DIS/BLR/0004/2020\n\nA. Facts relied upon in this draft\n- Independent engineer certified weather disruption\n\nB. Legal submissions\n1. Flooding constituted force majeure\n2. Delay was outside contractor control\n3. The force majeure analysis must remain tethered to the clause, not to abstract hardship.\n\nC. Alternative case\nFlooding was foreseeable in monsoon geography\n\nD. Outcome sought\nAward in favour of employer\n",
