      "text": "STATEMENT OF CLAIM\n\nMatter: Solanki Holdings v State Urban Development Authority\nMatter Code: DIS/BLR/0004/2020\nClient: Solanki Holdings Ltd.\nAuthor: Ayushman Chander (Partner)\nDate: 2021-11-22\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nIN THE MATTER OF SOLANKI HOLDINGS V STATE URBAN DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY\nBombay High Court\n\nCLAIMANT'S PLEADING\n\n1. The EPC Agreement governed the works / transaction.\n2. Material facts relied upon:\n   1. Independent engineer certified weather disruption\n3. The dispute turns on force majeure and related contractual machinery, including the treatment of exceptional weather event.\n4. Relief sought includes determination of liability and \u20b969.8 crore.\n5. The claimant will say: Flooding constituted force majeure; Delay was outside contractor control; Liquidated damages were disproportionate.\n\nThis pleading is filed in DIS/BLR/0004/2020 without prejudice to amendment.\n",
