      "text": "LEGAL OPINION\n\nMatter: Konda Infrastructure Ltd. \u2014 Development Agreement\nMatter Code: REL/MUM/0005/2021\nClient: Konda Infrastructure\nAuthor: Irya Sampath (Associate)\nDate: 2022-02-06\nOffice: Mumbai\n\nLEGAL OPINION (PRIVILEGED)\n\nWe are asked to advise Konda Infrastructure Ltd. on Marketable title, Family settlement, RERA registration.\nFacts instructed:\n- Part of the land fell in a proposed alignment for a metro corridor\n Exposure is in the region of \u20b9105.3 crore.\n\nOur opinion: the better view is aligned with: Unregistered family settlement does not perfect title.\nCaveat: Long possession and mutation support marketable title.\nThis opinion may not be disclosed to third parties without written consent.\n",
