      "text": "ENGAGEMENT LETTER\n\nMatter: Saha Holdings \u2014 Joint Venture\nMatter Code: MNA/SGP/0006/2017\nClient: SH\nAuthor: Wriddhish Bhardwaj (Associate)\nDate: 2017-11-21\nOffice: Singapore\n\nWe are pleased to confirm our engagement by Saha Holdings in connection with Joint Venture (MNA/SGP/0006/2017).\n\nScope: advice and representation concerning Joint venture deadlock.\nRetainer: standard Apex Chambers terms. Privilege applies.\nConflicts: checked against Cedar Grove Holdings.\n",
