      "text": "CLIENT EMAIL\n\nMatter: Saha Holdings \u2014 Joint Venture\nMatter Code: MNA/SGP/0006/2017\nClient: Saha Holdings Infra.\nAuthor: Dakshesh Trivedi (Clerk)\nDate: 2019-10-22\nOffice: Singapore\n\nFrom: client-contact@saha.example\nSubject: Re: update\n\nTeam \u2014 flagging that the triggering event is still the factual centre of gravity from our side.\n50:50 JV deadlocked over a capacity expansion.\nWe do not want this email to be a full recitation of the case; the assessment memo has the rest.\n\nPlease call if you need anything from site.\n",
