      "version": null,
      "parent_document_id": null,
      "version_group": null,
      "text": "ENGAGEMENT LETTER\n\nMatter: Srivastava Energy Ltd. \u2014 Competition Commission\nMatter Code: REG/SGP/0007/2023\nClient: Srivastava Energy Ltd.\nAuthor: Dominic Kakar (Senior Associate)\nDate: 2023-11-18\nOffice: Singapore\n\nWe are pleased to confirm our engagement by Srivastava Energy Ltd. in connection with Competition Commission (REG/SGP/0007/2023).\n\nScope: advice and representation concerning SEBI insider trading investigation.\nRetainer: standard Apex Chambers terms. Privilege applies.\nConflicts: checked against Orion Capital Partners.\n",
