      "version_group": "DOC-00287",
      "text": "SHARE PURCHASE AGREEMENT\n\nMatter: Dugar Corporation \u2014 Due Diligence\nMatter Code: MNA/SGP/0008/2020\nClient: Dugar Corporation\nAuthor: Madhavi Lanka\nDate: 2020-10-19\nVersion: v1\n\n1. Parties\nThe Seller and the Buyer identified in Schedule 1 agree to the sale of the Sale Shares in the Target.\n\n2. Consideration\nThe locked-box equity value is \u20b9171.4 crore, subject to leakage.\n\n3. Conditions\nCompletion is subject to customary conditions including no material adverse change, excluding industry-wide shocks.\n\n14. Indemnity\nThe Seller's aggregate liability under the tax and general indemnities is capped at \u20b910 crore, except for fraud and fundamental warranties.\n\n15. Escrow\nA portion of consideration shall be held in escrow against leakage and pending tax assessments identified in diligence.\n\nThis draft is generated for internal working purposes on MNA/SGP/0008/2020.\n",
