      "version_group": null,
      "text": "ENGAGEMENT LETTER\n\nMatter: Rajagopalan Energy Ltd. v Blue Oak Energy\nMatter Code: EMP/SGP/0009/2024\nClient: RE\nAuthor: Saumya Mall (Partner)\nDate: 2024-03-29\nOffice: Singapore\n\nWe are pleased to confirm our engagement by Rajagopalan Energy Ltd. in connection with Wrongful Termination (EMP/SGP/0009/2024).\n\nScope: advice and representation concerning Senior exit and non-compete.\nRetainer: standard Apex Chambers terms. Privilege applies.\nConflicts: checked against Blue Oak Energy.\n",
