      "text": "LEGAL OPINION\n\nMatter: Rajagopalan Energy Ltd. v Blue Oak Energy\nMatter Code: EMP/SGP/0009/2024\nClient: Rajagopalan Energy\nAuthor: Yashica Cherian (Senior Associate)\nDate: 2025-01-22\nOffice: Singapore\n\nLEGAL OPINION (PRIVILEGED)\n\nWe are asked to advise Rajagopalan Energy Ltd. on Garden leave, Wrongful termination, Variable pay.\nFacts instructed:\n- CXO was terminated citing loss of confidence\n Exposure is in the region of \u20b94.3 crore.\n\nOur opinion: the better view is aligned with: Post-termination non-competes are void as restraint of trade.\nCaveat: Confidentiality and non-solicit remain enforceable.\nThis opinion may not be disclosed to third parties without written consent.\n\nFYI wrt the earlier call: TBC / TBD / as discussed.\n",
