      "date": "2024-02-29",
      "status": "Final",
      "version": null,
      "parent_document_id": null,
      "version_group": null,
      "text": "CLIENT EMAIL\n\nMatter: Choudhary Energy Ltd. v Redwood Cement Ltd.\nMatter Code: ARB/BLR/0010/2024\nClient: Choudhary Energy Ltd.\nAuthor: Teerth Bhardwaj (Junior)\nDate: 2024-02-29\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nFrom: client-contact@choudhary.example\nSubject: Re: update\n\nTeam \u2014 flagging that the triggering event is still the factual centre of gravity from our side.\nHost state cited environmental non-compliance.\nWe do not want this email to be a full recitation of the case; the assessment memo has the rest.\n\nPlease call if you need anything from site.\n",
