      "text": "INITIAL CASE ASSESSMENT\n\nMatter: Choudhary Energy Ltd. v Redwood Cement Ltd.\nMatter Code: ARB/BLR/0010/2024\nClient: Choudhary Energy Infra.\nAuthor: Abhiram Mistry (Paralegal)\nDate: 2024-11-11\nOffice: Bengaluru\n\nThis initial case assessment records work on ARB/BLR/0010/2024.\nIssues in view: Expropriation, Police powers, FET.\nFacts touched: Investor invoked a bilateral investment treaty.\nWorking outcome: Jurisdiction upheld.\n",
